WEBVTT

00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:04.087
When un pivoting, decide what to do with missing cells.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:06.837
One option is to keep them.

00:00:06.837 --> 00:00:12.482
That preserves the fact that the category exists but the value is missing.

00:00:12.482 --> 00:00:17.967
Another option is to remove those generated rows after un pivoting.

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:21.097
Neither choice is automatically correct.

00:00:21.097 --> 00:00:25.410
The decision depends on whether missingness is meaningful for the analysis.
